abstract: >-
  A leakage-aware study of default-risk prediction at loan origination using
  LendingClub data, statistical and tree-based classifiers, operational
  screening curves, and a cross-fitted Double Machine Learning extension.
keywords:
  - credit risk
  - default prediction
  - origination screening
  - LendingClub
  - elastic net
  - random forest
  - double machine learning
